title: Fast Travel
tempo: 120
# desc: A swirl through the veil: a falling pulse-width sweep over rushing noise and a shimmer.
# use: Fast-travelling between shrines or zones.
# tags: rpg-ui, fast, travel, neutral, fast travel, teleport, warp, transition
# palette: neutral
# zone: any
# fit: core

instrument v1: pulse duty=0.5 volume=0.3 attack=0.002 release=0.1 slide=-24 slide_time=0.4 pwm=0.3 pwm_rate=20 decay=0.3 sustain=0.3
instrument v2: noise volume=0.2 attack=0.1 release=0.2 slide=-12 slide_time=0.4
instrument v3: fm volume=0.2 ratio=2 index=2 index_decay=0.4 attack=0.001 decay=0.5 sustain=0 release=0.05 echo=0.35

v1: C5:1.4 R:1.3
v2: C5:1.2 R:1.5
v3: R:1.1 G6:0.6 R:1
